{
 "noaniq": [
  "258: «five acres of land» — akr o‘lchov birligi o‘zgartirilmadi (besh akr).",
  "260: «until the first part of the 20th century» — «20-asrning birinchi yarmigacha» deb berildi; aslida Mendel ishi 1900-yilda qayta kashf etilgan (282 bilan mos), muallif lafzi saqlandi.",
  "260: «Natural History Society of Brno» — «Brno tabiatshunoslar jamiyati» deb berildi (asli: Naturforschender Verein in Brünn).",
  "261: hawkweed (Hieracium) uchun o‘zbekcha nom «qirg‘iyo‘t» deb tanlandi, o‘rnashgan nom ekani tekshirilsin; inglizcha asli qavsda berildi.",
  "264: «unitary and discrete» — «ham yaxlit, ham alohida-alohida» deb berildi; ma’nosi: belgilar bo‘linmas va aniq farqlanuvchi.",
  "270: muallif Pennet panjarasini Mendel yaratgan deb yozadi (aslida uni Reginald Punnett 1905-yil atrofida taklif qilgan); asldagidek tarjima qilindi.",
  "292: kariotiplar muallif yozganidek «22, XX» va «22, XY» qoldirildi (odatiy yozuv 46,XX va 46,XY).",
  "295: «There are those that not only have a ZW sex chromosome system, but the males are ZZ and the females are ZW» — gap tuzilishi chalkash; ma’no bo‘yicha «ZW tizimi bor, bunda erkaklar ZZ, urg‘ochilar ZW» deb berildi.",
  "298: «you would see no evidence of it unless that person had children who did not have the disease» — ma’no saqlanib, erkin tarjima qilindi.",
  "303: «half of all boys in the family would have the disease» — muallif lafzi saqlandi (statistik ehtimol ma’nosida).",
  "259, 271, 294, 297, 302, 304, 307, 310: rasmlar (⟦x:1⟧); rasm ichidagi yozuvlar tarjima qilinmadi, tekshirilsin."
 ],
